<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Breathe Thou upon us, Lord,</l><l>Thy Spirit’s living flame,</l><l>That so with one accord</l><l>Our lips may tell Thy name;</l><l>Give Thou the hearing ear,</l><l>Fix Thou the wandering thought,</l><l>That those we teach may hear</l><l>The great things Thou hast wrought.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Speak Thou for us, O Lord,</l><l>In all we say of Thee;</l><l>According to Thy Word</l><l>Let all our teaching be;</l><l>That so Thy lambs may know</l><l>Their own true Shepherd’s voice,</l><l>Where’er He leads them go,</l><l>And in His love rejoice.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Live Thou within us, Lord;</l><l>Thy mind and will be ours;</l><l>Be Thou beloved, adored,</l><l>And served with all our powers;</l><l>That so our lives may teach</l><l>Thy children what Thou art,</l><l>And plead, by more than speech,</l><l>For Thee with every heart.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
